<title>USA: Prodigy secures $179 mln private placement.</title>
<headline>Prodigy secures $179 mln private placement.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, Mass. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prodigy Inc said Monday it completed a private placement worth up to $179 million over the next 13 months.</p>
<p>The company said the placement was provided primarily by its majority shareholders, Carso Global Telecom SA de CV and Prodigy's chairman, Greg Carr.</p>
<p>The Internet Service Provider said the funding would be used to enhance the Prodigy Internet and expand overseas.</p>
